{
  spec: "[TSON-SCHEMA] §5.4 (nested choices, proposed for Revision 40)"
  description: """
    `outer` is `( boolean | narrow )` over `narrow => ( int32 | text )`. The tag names the variant `narrow`, so it
    selects it, and the value is read there untagged, as at a position typed by `narrow`, which is disjoint: `5` is
    number-class and goes to `int32`.
    """
  valid: _
